cess. Please notify Human Resources at (207) 725-3837 in advance so all necessary arrangements can be made confidentially. Staff & Casual contact: careers@bowdoin.edu Faculty contact: facultycareers@bowdoin.edu (t)207-725-3837 216 Maine Street, Brunswick, ME 04011 Bowdoin College is a member of the Diversity Hiring Coalition of Maine , and Live and Work in Maine . To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
